<title>USA: FNB Rochester sets div $0.05/shr.</title>
<headline>FNB Rochester sets div $0.05/shr.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>FNB Rochester Corp said on Tuesday it declared a one-time, cash dividend of $0.05 a share, payable January 31, to common stock shareholders on record as of January 15.</p>
<p>The dividend is the company's first cash dividend since 1991, the company said.</p>
